  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Open Data for Open Societies - Serbia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to leverage the benefits of opening, sharing, and collaborating around data to improve the level of democracy, accountability, transparency, and tackle societal challenges. The project will raise the ambition of the public open data ecosystem and elevate use of data as a strategy tool across government, in particular its use in audit and environmental protection. 
It will improve engagement of public institutions with citizens using open data and build data capabilities in the public sector. The project will empower more women to benefit from data skills and contribute to the use of open data for gender equality.</narrative>
  </description>
